<title>SINGAPORE: URA sells two land parcels, up to S$113 million.</title>
<headline>URA sells two land parcels, up to S$113 million.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Urban Redevelopment Authority (URA) said on Monday it sold two land parcels in its latest tender for Singapore $113 and S$101 million.</p>
<p>URA said in a statement the tender for one 59,664 sq m parcel was awarded to Malayan Credit Ltd and Magnerite Pte Ltd, for S$113 million.</p>
<p>The second parcel of the same size was awarded to Rutile Pte Ltd for $S101 million. Both parcels of land are in the eastern part of the island.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
